    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics is my lifeline. As a self-employed professional in economics and computer science, I rely on it daily for modeling and analysis. My PhD journey taught me that math isn't just abstract symbols but a powerful tool for understanding complex systems. While I dislike physics and chemistry, math feels like a language I speak fluently, essential for my work and intellectual growth.",
